  by `bin/choupo-curate pairs --models --promote`: fit grade clean -- max
  |dT| 0.626 K over the 156 kept points, one liquid across the validity
  span.
  @@MODELS-RESULT-END@@

  @@RESULT-BEGIN@@
  WHAT THE RUN FOUND (pinned in `expected`; measured, not argued).
  fit_nrtl: b_ij = 103.6 K, b_ji = 112.5 K over 156 kept points of 7
